00:58:27.180 --> 00:58:34.290
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who thinks our show would be a lot more popular if we would just take his advice.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，他认为如果我们听从他的建议，节目会受欢迎得多。

00:58:34.290 --> 00:58:41.250
<v Steve Malarkey>You've got to give them some birds and squirrels. They don't care one iota if they're fighting or sleeping or whatever.
<v Steve Malarkey>你得给它们看一些鸟和松鼠。它们一点也不在乎它们是在打架、睡觉还是别的什么。

00:58:41.250 --> 00:58:45.220
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:45.220 --> 00:58:54.830
<v Steve Malarkey>Yeah, that's the bread and butter is the birds and squirrels.
<v Steve Malarkey>是的，鸟和松鼠就是主打产品。

00:58:54.830 --> 00:58:59.830
